<title>USA: McCormick to repurchase up to 10 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>McCormick to repurchase up to 10 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>SPARKS, Md. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>McCormick &amp; Co Inc said Thursday it planned to repurchase up to 10 million shares of its common stock.  </p>
<p>The spice and seasonings maker said it has about 81 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
